  _title: Incubadora de Startups
  _titleEn: Startup Incubator
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Incubadoras oferecem espa\xE7o, mentoria e contatos para empresas nascentes
    de tecnologia nos primeiros anos."
  _summaryEn: Incubators provide space, mentoring and contacts for young technology
    companies in their first years.
  _realWorld: "O Cietec, incubadora ligada \xE0 USP em S\xE3o Paulo, j\xE1 apoiou
    centenas de empresas de base tecnol\xF3gica."
  _realWorldEn: "Cietec, an incubator linked to the University of S\xE3o Paulo, has
    supported hundreds of technology-based companies."
  _tradeOffs: A maioria das startups fecha, e o retorno em empregos e impostos demora
    anos.
  _tradeOffsEn: Most startups close, and the payoff in jobs and taxes takes years.
